{"id":"slozhit_","lemma":"сложить","pos":"verb","rank":4066,"glosses":["to lay together, to put together, to pile up, to heap, to stack","to pack up","to add, to sum up"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/92/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"сложу","2s":"сложишь","3s":"сложит","1p":"сложим","2p":"сложите","3p":"сложат"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"сложи","2p":"сложите"}}},"past":{"m":"сложил","p":"сложили","f":"сложила","n":"сложило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"складывать","examples":[{"text":"Если сложить три и четыре, получится семь.","en":"If you add three and four, you get seven.","words":[{"g":"if, in case"},null,{"g":"three"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"four"},{"g":"to come in, to arrive","l":"получиться"},{"g":"seven"}]},{"text":"Он, наверное, сложил их у стены.","en":"He must have stacked them up against the wall.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"probably, most likely"},null,{"g":"them / their"},{"g":"at / by"},null]},{"text":"Я могу сложить вещи в коробку.","en":"I can put things in a box.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"thing, object","l":"вещь"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Сложите всё в коробку.","en":"Put everything in the box.","words":[null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Том сложил одно с другим.","en":"Tom put two and two together.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null,{"g":"with / from"},null]}]}